#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Irreversible migrations"
msgstr "Migrations irreversíveis"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "Not all migrations are reversible. For example, if the `up()` method deletes a row of a table, you may not be able to recover this row in the `down()` method. Sometimes, you may be just too lazy to implement the `down()`, because it is not very common to revert database migrations. In this case, you should implement `Yiisoft\\Db\\Migration\\MigrationInterface` that has `up()` only."
msgstr "Nem todas as migrations são reversíveis. Por exemplo, se o método `up()` apaga uma linha de uma tabela, talvez você não consiga recuperar essa linha no método `down()`. Às vezes, você pode simplesmente não querer implementar o `down()`, porque não é muito comum reverter migrations. Nesse caso, implemente `Yiisoft\\Db\\Migration\\MigrationInterface`, que tem apenas `up()`."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transactional migrations"
msgstr "Migrations transacionais"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "While performing complex DB migrations, it is important to ensure each migration to either succeed or fail as a whole so that the database can maintain integrity and consistency. To achieve this goal, it is recommended that you may enclose the DB operations of each migration in a transaction automatically by adding `TransactionalMigrationInterface` to `implements` of your migration."
msgstr "Ao executar migrations complexas, é importante garantir que cada migration tenha sucesso ou falhe por completo, para que o banco de dados mantenha a integridade e a consistência. Para isso, é recomendado envolver automaticamente as operações de banco de cada migration em uma transação, adicionando `TransactionalMigrationInterface` ao `implements` da sua migration."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "As a result, if any operation in the `up()` or `down()` method fails, all prior operations will be rolled back automatically."
msgstr "Assim, se qualquer operação no método `up()` ou `down()` falhar, todas as operações anteriores serão desfeitas (rollback) automaticamente."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> Note: Not all DBMS support transactions. And some DB queries cannot be put into a transaction. For some examples,\n"
"please refer to [implicit commit](https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/5.7/en/implicit-commit.html).\n"
msgstr ""
"> Nota: nem todo SGBD dá suporte a transações. E algumas consultas não podem ser colocadas em uma transação. Para alguns exemplos,\n"
"consulte [implicit commit](https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/5.7/en/implicit-commit.html).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generating a migration"
msgstr "Gerando uma migration"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "Instead of writing migrations by hand, the command provides a convenient way generate some of the code."
msgstr "Em vez de escrever migrations à mão, o comando oferece uma forma prática de gerar parte do código."

#. type: Fenced code block (shell)
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"make shell\n"
"./yii migrate:create -- my_first_table --command=table --fields=name,example --table-comment=my_first_table\n"
msgstr ""
"make shell\n"
"./yii migrate:create -- my_first_table --command=table --fields=name,example --table-comment=my_first_table\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "That would generate the following:"
msgstr "Isso geraria o seguinte:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace App\\Migration;\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Migration\\MigrationBuilder;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Migration\\RevertibleMigrationInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Migration\\TransactionalMigrationInterface;\n"
"\n"
"/**\n"
" * Handles the creation of table `my_first_table`.\n"
" */\n"
"final class M251227095006CreateMyFirstTableTable implements RevertibleMigrationInterface, TransactionalMigrationInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    public function up(MigrationBuilder $b): void\n"
"    {\n"
"        $columnBuilder = $b->columnBuilder();\n"
"\n"
"        $b->createTable('my_first_table', [\n"
"            'id' => $columnBuilder::primaryKey(),\n"
"            'name',\n"
"            'example',\n"
"        ]);\n"
"\n"
"        $b->addCommentOnTable('my_first_table', 'my_first_table');\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function down(MigrationBuilder $b): void\n"
"    {\n"
"        $b->dropTable('my_first_table');\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace App\\Migration;\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Migration\\MigrationBuilder;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Migration\\RevertibleMigrationInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Migration\\TransactionalMigrationInterface;\n"
"\n"
"/**\n"
" * Handles the creation of table `my_first_table`.\n"
" */\n"
"final class M251227095006CreateMyFirstTableTable implements RevertibleMigrationInterface, TransactionalMigrationInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    public function up(MigrationBuilder $b): void\n"
"    {\n"
"        $columnBuilder = $b->columnBuilder();\n"
"\n"
"        $b->createTable('my_first_table', [\n"
"            'id' => $columnBuilder::primaryKey(),\n"
"            'name',\n"
"            'example',\n"
"        ]);\n"
"\n"
"        $b->addCommentOnTable('my_first_table', 'my_first_table');\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function down(MigrationBuilder $b): void\n"
"    {\n"
"        $b->dropTable('my_first_table');\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "Commands available are:"
msgstr "Os comandos disponíveis são:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "create - empty migration."
msgstr "create - migration vazia."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "table - creating a table. Use `--fields` specify a list of fields to use. Types could be specified as well such as `id:primaryKey,name:string:defaultValue(\"Alex\"),user_id:integer:foreignKey,category_id2:integer:foreignKey(category id2)`."
msgstr "table - cria uma tabela. Use `--fields` para especificar a lista de campos. Também é possível especificar os tipos, como em `id:primaryKey,name:string:defaultValue(\"Alex\"),user_id:integer:foreignKey,category_id2:integer:foreignKey(category id2)`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "dropTable - dropping a table."
msgstr "dropTable - remove uma tabela."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "addColumn - adding a column."
msgstr "addColumn - adiciona uma coluna."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "dropColumn - dropping a column."
msgstr "dropColumn - remove uma coluna."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "junction - creating a junction table. Use `--and` specify a second table."
msgstr "junction - cria uma tabela de junção. Use `--and` para especificar a segunda tabela."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Applying Migrations"
msgstr "Aplicando migrations"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "To upgrade a database to its latest structure, you should apply all available new migrations using the following command:"
msgstr "Para atualizar um banco de dados para a estrutura mais recente, aplique todas as migrations novas disponíveis com o seguinte comando:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md ../src/guide/security/authorization.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "./yii migrate:up\n"
msgstr "./yii migrate:up\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "This command will list all migrations that have not been applied so far. If you confirm that you want to apply these migrations, it will run the `up()` method in every new migration class, one after another, in the order of their timestamp values. If any of the migrations fails, the command will quit without applying the rest of the migrations."
msgstr "Esse comando lista todas as migrations que ainda não foram aplicadas. Se você confirmar que quer aplicá-las, ele executa o método `up()` de cada nova classe de migration, uma após a outra, na ordem de seus timestamps. Se alguma das migrations falhar, o comando é encerrado sem aplicar as demais."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "For each migration that has been successfully applied, the command will insert a row into a database table named `migration` to record the successful application of the migration. This will allow the migration tool to identify which migrations have been applied and which have not."
msgstr "Para cada migration aplicada com sucesso, o comando insere uma linha em uma tabela do banco chamada `migration` para registrar a aplicação bem-sucedida. Isso permite que a ferramenta de migrations identifique quais migrations foram aplicadas e quais não foram."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "Sometimes, you may only want to apply one or a few new migrations, instead of all available migrations.  You can do so by specifying the number of migrations that you want to apply when running the command.  For example, the following command will try to apply the next three available migrations:"
msgstr "Às vezes, você pode querer aplicar apenas uma ou algumas migrations novas, em vez de todas as disponíveis.  Você pode fazer isso especificando o número de migrations que quer aplicar ao executar o comando.  Por exemplo, o comando a seguir tenta aplicar as próximas três migrations disponíveis:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "./yii migrate:up --limit=3\n"
msgstr "./yii migrate:up --limit=3\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reverting Migrations"
msgstr "Revertendo migrations"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "To revert (undo) one or multiple migrations that have been applied before, you can run the following command:"
msgstr "Para reverter (desfazer) uma ou várias migrations aplicadas anteriormente, execute o seguinte comando:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"./yii migrate:down            # revert the most recently applied migration\n"
"./yii migrate:down --limit=3  # revert the most 3 recently applied migrations\n"
"./yii migrate:down --all      # revert all migrations\n"
msgstr ""
"./yii migrate:down            # reverte a migration aplicada mais recentemente\n"
"./yii migrate:down --limit=3  # reverte as 3 migrations aplicadas mais recentemente\n"
"./yii migrate:down --all      # reverte todas as migrations\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> Note: Not all migrations are reversible. Trying to revert such migrations will cause an error and stop the\n"
"entire reverting process.\n"
msgstr ""
"> Nota: nem todas as migrations são reversíveis. Tentar reverter uma migration assim causa um erro e interrompe\n"
"todo o processo de reversão.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Redoing Migrations"
msgstr "Refazendo migrations"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "Redoing migrations means first reverting the specified migrations and then applying again. This can be done as follows:"
msgstr "Refazer migrations significa primeiro reverter as migrations especificadas e depois aplicá-las novamente. Isso pode ser feito assim:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"./yii migrate:redo            # redo the last applied migration\n"
"./yii migrate:redo --limit=3  # redo the last 3 applied migrations\n"
"./yii migrate:redo --all      # redo all migrations\n"
msgstr ""
"./yii migrate:redo            # refaz a última migration aplicada\n"
"./yii migrate:redo --limit=3  # refaz as 3 últimas migrations aplicadas\n"
"./yii migrate:redo --all      # refaz todas as migrations\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "> Note: If a migration is not reversible, you will not be able to redo it.\n"
msgstr "> Nota: se uma migration não for reversível, você não conseguirá refazê-la.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Listing Migrations"
msgstr "Listando migrations"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "To list which migrations have been applied and which are not, you may use the following commands:"
msgstr "Para listar quais migrations foram aplicadas e quais não foram, use os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"./yii migrate/history            # showing the last 10 applied migrations\n"
"./yii migrate:history --limit=5  # showing the last 5 applied migrations\n"
"./yii migrate:history --all      # showing all applied migrations\n"
"\n"
"./yii migrate:new                # showing the first 10 new migrations\n"
"./yii migrate:new --limit=5      # showing the first 5 new migrations\n"
"./yii migrate:new --all          # showing all new migrations\n"
msgstr ""
"./yii migrate/history            # mostra as 10 últimas migrations aplicadas\n"
"./yii migrate:history --limit=5  # mostra as 5 últimas migrations aplicadas\n"
"./yii migrate:history --all      # mostra todas as migrations aplicadas\n"
"\n"
"./yii migrate:new                # mostra as 10 primeiras migrations novas\n"
"./yii migrate:new --limit=5      # mostra as 5 primeiras migrations novas\n"
"./yii migrate:new --all          # mostra todas as migrations novas\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrading from Yii 2.0"
msgstr "Migrando do Yii 2.0"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "Migrations in Yii 2.0 and the [yiisoft/db-migration](https://github.com/yiisoft/db-migration/) package are not compatible, and the `migration` table is also not compatible."
msgstr "As migrations do Yii 2.0 e o pacote [yiisoft/db-migration](https://github.com/yiisoft/db-migration/) não são compatíveis, e a tabela `migration` também não é compatível."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/databases/db-migrations.md
msgid "A probable solution is to use structure dumps and rename the old `migration` table. Upon the initial execution of migrations, a new `migration` table with new fields will be created. All further changes in the database schema are applied using the new `migration` component and recorded in the new migration table."
msgstr "Uma solução possível é usar dumps da estrutura e renomear a tabela `migration` antiga. Na primeira execução das migrations, uma nova tabela `migration` com os novos campos será criada. Todas as mudanças seguintes no schema do banco de dados são aplicadas usando o novo componente `migration` e registradas na nova tabela de migrations."
